From 39f98389a1f1f51c5ffc652d236e53732270e928 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Radim=20Vesel=C3=BD?= <Bright4042x@yahoo.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:45:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 39/55] winemac: manage native fullscreen and refresh it on
 activation

Enter native fullscreen for eligible Win32 fullscreen windows on macOS 27.
Keep queued content clicks on Wine's input path and preserve finite cursor
confinement. Restore fullscreen intent after temporary hiding and refresh
effective presentation policy and existing confinement after activation.

Older supported systems retain Wine's original path. Ordinary decorated
windows are not promoted. Game Mode and game-host packaging are excluded.

Validation: isolated five-object driver build, SDK-guard-disabled compilation,
26 focused controls and exact source/patch replay. Backrooms Dock recovery was
verified in the recorded development runtime. Enshrouded Windowed geometry
remains unresolved; another game's Windowed control was reported working.

(cherry picked from commit 333ef8f2017d80d98e831b408257451c12fa374f)
